# Editor swap/backup files, repo-wide. tests/.gitignore already covers these, but a
# committed .env.swp once leaked a signed Jahia EE license past a `.env` rule — a swap
# file has a different name than the file it shadows, so the rule must be by pattern.
*.sw?
*~
.env
.env.*
!.env.example